Band Visual & Press Photoshoot Prompt: High-contrast, cinematic image capturing The Lumina-Lepidoptera performing in a dimly lit, hydroponic bay aboard a generation ship. Bioluminescent flora casts eerie, pulsating greens and blues on their faces. "Captain Bassline" is hunched over a rack of salvaged synths, wires snaking like vines, wearing a weathered flight suit. "Syncopation-Sister" floats delicately mid-air, manipulating ethereal, transparent drum pads that shimmer with internal light. "Vox-Navigator" stands center, arms outstretched, clad in a flowing, iridescent moth-wing cloak that catches the light like a dying star, a single tear of condensation tracing a path down her cheek. The backdrop shows blurry, distant stars through a curved, porthole-like window, implying vast cosmic emptiness outside.

